// Generated from the case tables that were adjudicated against Linux-on-ARM
// emulation (see docs/gate-logs/2026-11-23-arm64-isa-coverage.md): every image
// is a run of single-instruction probes that leave their own pass/fail bit in
// w20 and exit with the number of mismatching checks, so 0 is the only good
// status. Each probe seeds the registers it reads, so no case can mask another.

